@startuml builder-classes-depois-v1
title Builder aplicado a StreamConfig — diagrama de classes (depois)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<Product>> #DAE8FC
  BackgroundColor<<Builder>> #FFE6CC
  BackgroundColor<<ConcreteBuilder>> #FFE6CC
  BackgroundColor<<Director>> #E1D5E7
  BackgroundColor<<Existente>> #F5F5F5
  BackgroundColor<<Error>> #F8CECC
}
hide empty members

class LiveStreamService <<Existente>> {
  + createStream(userId: UUID, config: StreamConfig): LiveStream
}

class "StreamConfig" as StreamConfig <<Product>> {
  + {readonly} title: string
  + {readonly} visibility: ContentVisibility
  + {readonly} latencyMode: LatencyMode
  + {readonly} recordAutomatically: boolean
  + {readonly} resolution: Resolution
  + {readonly} framesPerSecond: number
  + {readonly} bitrateBps: number
  - StreamConfig(fields)
}

interface StreamConfigBuilder <<Builder>> {
  + withTitle(title: string): StreamConfigBuilder
  + withVisibility(v: ContentVisibility): StreamConfigBuilder
  + withLatencyMode(m: LatencyMode): StreamConfigBuilder
  + withRecording(enabled: boolean): StreamConfigBuilder
  + withVideo(res: Resolution, fps: number, bitrateBps: number): StreamConfigBuilder
  + reset(): StreamConfigBuilder
  + build(): StreamConfig
}

class DefaultStreamConfigBuilder <<ConcreteBuilder>> {
  - title: string [0..1]
  - visibility: ContentVisibility = PUBLIC
  - latencyMode: LatencyMode = STANDARD
  - recordAutomatically: boolean = true
  - resolution: Resolution [0..1]
  - framesPerSecond: number [0..1]
  - bitrateBps: number [0..1]
  + build(): StreamConfig
  - validate(): void
}

class StreamConfigDirector <<Director>> {
  + lowLatency(title: string): StreamConfig
  + highQuality(title: string): StreamConfig
  + mobile(title: string): StreamConfig
}

class InvalidStreamConfigError <<Error>> {
  + violations: string[]
}

enum LatencyMode <<Existente>> {
  STANDARD
  LOW
  ULTRA_LOW
}
enum ContentVisibility <<Existente>> {
  PUBLIC
  UNLISTED
  PRIVATE
}
enum Resolution {
  R360P
  R480P
  R720P
  R1080P
  R1440P
  R2160P
}

StreamConfigBuilder <|.. DefaultStreamConfigBuilder
DefaultStreamConfigBuilder ..> StreamConfig : <<create>>
DefaultStreamConfigBuilder ..> InvalidStreamConfigError : <<throws>>
StreamConfigDirector o--> StreamConfigBuilder : builder
LiveStreamService ..> StreamConfig : entrada
StreamConfig --> LatencyMode
StreamConfig --> ContentVisibility
StreamConfig --> Resolution

note right of DefaultStreamConfigBuilder
  validate() — regras checadas em build():
  R1 título não vazio
  R2 resolução, fps e bitrate informados juntos
  R3 fps ≤ 60
  R4 latência LOW/ULTRA_LOW incompatível com 2160p
  R5 bitrate ≥ mínimo da faixa resolução × fps
end note

note bottom of StreamConfigDirector
  Escopo de Heitor Macedo Ricardo.
